---
[v1] net: ethernet: mtk_eth_soc: enable L3 length overrun drop and
 add page information dump for NETSYSv3.1

This change enables L3 length overrun dropping to prevent abnormal
packets from entering PSE, and adds an abnormal packet handler for
NETSYSv3.1 to provide debug information for troubleshooting.
---
v1: enable L3 length overrun drop and add page information dump for NETSYSv3.1
---

From add4294cfeeace89aa202c0c6e4aa143b195d9d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bo-Cun Chen <bc-bocun.chen@mediatek.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 14:40:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mtk_eth_soc: enable L3 length overrun drop and
 add page information dump for NETSYSv3.1

This change enables L3 length overrun dropping to prevent abnormal
